      <h4><code>card.transaction</code> data</h4>
      <table class="docs-table">
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>cardReference</code></td><td>The card's reference</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>cardAlias</code></td><td>Same as <code>cardReference</code> (UnionPay's name for it)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>callReference</code></td><td>UnionPay's id for this event; use it when you contact support</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>merchant.name</code>, <code>.mcc</code>, <code>.localDateTime</code></td><td>Where and when the card was used (name usually includes the town and country; <code>mcc</code> is the merchant category code)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>transactionDetails.transactionAmount</code>, <code>.transactionCurrencyCode</code></td><td>Amount and currency at the merchant</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>transactionDetails.settlementAmount</code>, <code>.settlementCurrencyCode</code>, <code>.settlementConversionRate</code></td><td>What the card was charged when the merchant used another currency; <code>null</code> otherwise</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>transactionDetails.maskedPan</code></td><td>Masked card number, last four digits only</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>transactionDetails.type</code></td><td><code>{ code, description, isReversal }</code>. <code>code</code> is the ISO 8583 processing code, e.g. <code>00</code> Authorisation (goods and services), <code>01</code> Cash withdrawal, <code>09</code> Goods and services with cash back, <code>20</code> Returns (refund), <code>21</code> Deposit. When a merchant reverses a payment, <code>description</code> starts with <code>[Reversal]</code> and <code>isReversal</code> is <code>true</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>transactionDetails.status</code></td><td><code>{ code, isSuccessful, reason }</code>. <code>code</code> is the ISO 8583 response code, e.g. <code>00</code> Approved, <code>05</code> Do not honor, <code>13</code> Invalid amount, <code>41</code> Lost card, <code>43</code> Stolen card, <code>51</code> Not sufficient funds. Check <code>isSuccessful</code> rather than the code.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
