      <p class="docs-small">A good message to your customer: "534756 is your code to pay KES 250 at JUMIA KENYA. Never share it." Only send it to the cardholder's own phone or app.</p>
      <h4><code>card.details_otp</code> data</h4>
      <table class="docs-table">
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>cardReference</code></td><td>The card you asked about</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>challengeId</code></td><td>Matches the <code>challengeId</code> from step 1</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>otp</code></td><td>The 6-digit code. Use it once, then discard it.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>expiresAt</code></td><td>When the code stops working (5 minutes)</td></tr>
