    <section id="errors" class="docs-section">
      <h2>Errors</h2>
      <p>Errors come back as JSON with a <code>message</code> you can show or log.</p>
      <table class="docs-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>400</code></td><td>The request is invalid, or UnionPay refused it (its message is passed on).</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>401</code></td><td>Missing, invalid or expired token; wrong client secret; credential switched off.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>403</code></td><td>IP not on the whitelist, business not approved, credential lacks the scope, or too many failed token attempts.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>404</code></td><td>No card with that reference in your business.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>502</code></td><td>UnionPay could not be reached. Try again shortly.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
